Here is a simple example of using CluE on a protein, MBP.  First run

```
python3 get_mbp.py
```
to use `chilife` to download 1OMP and spin label it at site 66.  Next run
```
<clue> config.toml
```
with `<clue>` replaced by the path to the CluE binary.  This should generate a directory `CluE-<id>`. Run

```
python3 plot.py CluE-<id>
```
to plot the Hahn echo decay at `CluE-<id>/fig.png`.
